{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provides a high-level interface for implementing undo and redo operations."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/maxSteps","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/versionChanged"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/addDoMethod(callable:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/addDoProperty(object:property:value:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/addDoReference(object:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/addUndoMethod(callable:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/addUndoProperty(object:property:value:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/addUndoReference(object:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/clearHistory(increaseVersion:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/commitAction(execute:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/createAction(name:mergeMode:backwardUndoOps:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/endForceKeepInMergeEnds()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/getActionName(id:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/getCurrentAction()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/getCurrentActionName()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/getHistoryCount()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/getVersion()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/hasRedo()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/hasUndo()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo\/isCommittingAction()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGod